WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.166
Mr.

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:00.867
Vice President,

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:03.303
it is so nice to see you here in Kiev.

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.338
I know you met with President

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:06.439
Zelensky today.

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:07.374
You were in Butcher.

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:09.275
You were in urging

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:09.743
your fellow

00:00:09.743 --> 00:00:11.177
Republican presidential candidates,

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.013
meantime, are in early primary states.

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:14.514
They're holding fundraisers.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:16.683
Why does it matter to you to be here?

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:18.451
America's as the leader

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:20.020
of the free world.

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:22.655
Or the arsenal of democracy.

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:24.224
And from the very moment

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:26.459
that Russia engaged in this unprovoked

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:29.596
act of aggression,

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:31.998
invading a neighboring country,

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:36.536
I've strongly supported

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:37.337
American efforts

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:38.505
to give the Ukrainian fighters

00:00:38.505 --> 00:00:41.741
what they need to fight and and win.

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:43.043
And I must tell you,

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.611
traveling across those battlefields

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:45.278
today,

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:46.613
meeting with soldiers, meeting

00:00:46.613 --> 00:00:47.614
with families, meeting

00:00:47.614 --> 00:00:49.115
with President Zelensky,

00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:50.383
and then seeing the division

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:52.052
that we're seeing in Russia

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:54.154
over the last week, I'm more convinced

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:55.121
than ever

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.124
that the support that

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.492
the American people have provided,

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:00.760
the free world

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.695
has provided, is making it possible

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:03.897
for Ukraine

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:05.498
to reclaim their sovereignty, reclaim

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:07.067
their territory,

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:10.203
and and do a great service

00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:11.905
to peace in the world.

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:14.340
Look, I think that

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.810
that repelling Russian aggression

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:18.478
is not just in the interests

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:19.712
of the people here in Kiev

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:20.447
and in Ukraine.

00:01:20.447 --> 00:01:22.816
I think it's in our national interest

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:25.351
because I think it's in the interest

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:27.320
of the United States of America

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:28.955
and free countries around the world,

00:01:28.955 --> 00:01:30.457
because by giving Ukraine

00:01:30.457 --> 00:01:31.524
what they need to repel

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:33.226
the Russian invasion,

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:34.994
we're not only going to send a message

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:36.129
to Russia

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:37.497
that there are efforts

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:38.832
to redraw international lines

00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:40.567
by force will not be tolerated.

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:42.602
But other nations like China

00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:44.404
that's continuing to engage

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:46.539
in menacing military actions

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:47.640
across the Asia-Pacific

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:48.441
will get the message

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:51.111
that the free world will stand together

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:53.680
and precisely as we've done here

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:55.215
and watching the courageous

00:01:55.215 --> 00:01:57.050
fighters here in Ukraine today,

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:58.351
it's been deeply inspiring.

00:01:58.351 --> 00:02:00.887
We've just returned from the front lines

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:02.255
in southern Ukraine

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:05.058
and we saw the troops living camouflage

00:02:05.058 --> 00:02:06.893
in the woods, literally every woods.

00:02:06.893 --> 00:02:08.461
And then there be a farm field. Right.

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:10.263
But in that strip of woods,

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:11.998
their camouflage, their heavy equipment

00:02:11.998 --> 00:02:13.266
and they're living there full time

00:02:13.266 --> 00:02:14.534
Ukrainian troops,

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:15.468
they're dealing with

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:16.202
just fields

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:17.670
littered with mines

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:18.838
and grenades

00:02:18.838 --> 00:02:20.874
where they're these little tiny wires

00:02:21.107 --> 00:02:22.742
that no one would see

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:24.210
littering the woods.

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:26.779
Do you see an end in sight to a

00:02:26.779 --> 00:02:27.981
war like this?

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:31.151
I do.

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:31.851
And and

00:02:31.851 --> 00:02:34.120
when I met with President Zelensky today,

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:34.621
he said that

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:36.189
after a slow start

00:02:36.189 --> 00:02:37.157
this spring, largely

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:39.692
owing to a very rainy season

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:41.361
that they've been seeing in recent weeks,

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:42.362
a steady advance

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:44.464
against those Russian lines.

00:02:44.464 --> 00:02:45.532
And I have to tell you.

00:02:45.532 --> 00:02:48.134
Remember, wars are fought

00:02:48.134 --> 00:02:49.869
with soldiers,

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:52.238
with munitions and with morale.

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:53.907
And what I'm

00:02:53.907 --> 00:02:56.009
sure you saw on the front lines today

00:02:56.109 --> 00:02:57.544
and what I witnessed talking

00:02:57.544 --> 00:02:58.645
not only to the leadership

00:02:58.645 --> 00:02:59.712
of this country,

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:01.714
but to rank and file soldiers

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:04.384
was a genuine spirit.

00:03:05.151 --> 00:03:06.452
They see the progress.

00:03:06.452 --> 00:03:07.987
They see the fight they've put up.

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:10.423
I mean, it's amazing to think, Aaron.

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:11.958
Russia went from having the second

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:13.927
most powerful military in the world

00:03:13.927 --> 00:03:14.627
to having the second

00:03:14.627 --> 00:03:16.930
most powerful military in Ukraine.

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:18.598
I mean, Ukrainian fighters

00:03:18.598 --> 00:03:19.499
have demonstrated

00:03:19.499 --> 00:03:20.900
their toughness

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:23.136
equipped so well by the United States

00:03:23.536 --> 00:03:25.171
and other allies that we've marshaled

00:03:25.171 --> 00:03:27.407
some 50 countries around the world.

00:03:27.407 --> 00:03:30.243
But I think the morale here in Ukraine

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:30.977
the progress

00:03:30.977 --> 00:03:32.178
that I heard about from President

00:03:32.178 --> 00:03:33.746
Zelensky today

00:03:33.746 --> 00:03:36.049
and the division that we're seeing

00:03:36.482 --> 00:03:38.151
of the leader of the Bognor group,

00:03:38.151 --> 00:03:40.053
literally marching on Moscow

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:42.388
and now being exiled to Belarus and

00:03:42.388 --> 00:03:43.289
and Vladimir Putin

00:03:43.289 --> 00:03:44.691
literally flying troops

00:03:44.691 --> 00:03:46.626
from those front lines back to Moscow

00:03:46.626 --> 00:03:47.727
to reinforce

00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:48.261
I mean,

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:48.962
I mean, that's

00:03:48.962 --> 00:03:51.030
what happens when you engage in

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:52.799
an unprovoked act

00:03:52.799 --> 00:03:53.900
of naked aggression

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.501
against your neighbor.

00:03:55.501 --> 00:03:56.803
Innocent lives are lost.

00:03:56.803 --> 00:03:58.805
Your soldiers lives are lost,

00:03:58.805 --> 00:03:59.772
and you only sow

00:03:59.772 --> 00:04:01.140
division in your country.

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:03.443
That's what's happening in Russia today.

00:04:03.443 --> 00:04:04.177
And the morale

00:04:04.177 --> 00:04:05.111
that you saw today

00:04:05.111 --> 00:04:06.512
on those front lines,

00:04:06.512 --> 00:04:07.981
I think, is going to carry them forward

00:04:07.981 --> 00:04:08.881
to victory.

00:04:08.881 --> 00:04:10.583
You mentioned Putin,

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:11.851
and of course, you've met him.

00:04:11.851 --> 00:04:12.518
You dealt with him

00:04:12.518 --> 00:04:14.020
when you were vice president.

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:16.222
Do you think he has full command

00:04:16.623 --> 00:04:17.890
of his military right now?

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:19.292
I think it's an open question.

00:04:19.292 --> 00:04:19.859
It is.

00:04:19.859 --> 00:04:21.728
Now, the Wagner Group is a

00:04:21.728 --> 00:04:22.996
specialty group.

00:04:22.996 --> 00:04:24.264
We have some familiarity

00:04:24.264 --> 00:04:27.033
with we American forces encountered

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:30.036
the Wagner Group in Syria back in 2018

00:04:30.036 --> 00:04:31.537
when they moved against our forces.

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:34.340
And after being warned multiple times

00:04:35.575 --> 00:04:37.210
the order was given and we took them out

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:38.945
without one American casualty.

00:04:38.945 --> 00:04:40.780
But they are understood

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:41.080
to be

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:43.950
some of the most elite forces in Russia.

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.118
Now they've been dispersed.

00:04:45.118 --> 00:04:45.985
They're being invited

00:04:45.985 --> 00:04:47.687
back into the military.

00:04:47.687 --> 00:04:48.788
But I did hear today

00:04:48.788 --> 00:04:51.891
that they are decamping in Belarus,

00:04:51.891 --> 00:04:53.526
along with their

00:04:53.526 --> 00:04:55.161
their leader who is now in exile.

00:04:55.161 --> 00:04:57.330
And I must just tell you that

00:04:57.930 --> 00:04:59.999
we don't know what we don't know

00:04:59.999 --> 00:05:01.367
about what's happening in Russia,

00:05:01.367 --> 00:05:04.070
but that's always true about about Russia

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:05.204
and about Vladimir Putin.

00:05:05.204 --> 00:05:06.272
But what I do know,

00:05:06.272 --> 00:05:08.574
being here in Ukraine today,

00:05:08.574 --> 00:05:10.977
is the resolve of Ukrainians

00:05:10.977 --> 00:05:13.179
from President Zelensky

00:05:13.179 --> 00:05:13.846
down to that

00:05:13.846 --> 00:05:15.782
mother that I met in her pain

00:05:15.782 --> 00:05:17.784
whose home had been rebuilt.

00:05:17.784 --> 00:05:19.952
She was there when the rockets landed.

00:05:20.219 --> 00:05:22.322
She lost a nephew in the attack,

00:05:22.522 --> 00:05:24.891
but she never left. She rebuilt our home.

00:05:25.258 --> 00:05:26.559
And she's she's she

00:05:26.559 --> 00:05:27.694
and the Ukrainian people

00:05:27.694 --> 00:05:29.462
are fighting for their freedom.

00:05:29.462 --> 00:05:31.264
And with the support of the free world,

00:05:31.264 --> 00:05:33.232
with America as a leader of free world,

00:05:33.232 --> 00:05:34.200
I know they can win.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.968
So there are a lot of reports.

00:05:35.968 --> 00:05:36.636
And as you point out,

00:05:36.636 --> 00:05:38.438
we don't know what we don't know about

00:05:38.438 --> 00:05:39.439
what's going on in Moscow

00:05:39.439 --> 00:05:41.441
that that is normal. But we don't know.

00:05:41.441 --> 00:05:42.608
But there are reports about what

00:05:42.608 --> 00:05:44.577
top Putin inner circle members

00:05:44.577 --> 00:05:47.046
knew and did regarding promotion

00:05:47.113 --> 00:05:49.248
to attempted rebellion.

00:05:49.248 --> 00:05:51.117
Do you think it's possible

00:05:51.117 --> 00:05:52.618
that Prigozhin had inside

00:05:52.618 --> 00:05:53.886
help from key members

00:05:53.886 --> 00:05:56.022
of Putin's inner circle?

00:05:56.022 --> 00:05:58.257
I just I just wouldn't doubt it,

00:05:58.524 --> 00:05:59.726
but I wouldn't know.

00:05:59.726 --> 00:06:01.894
Yeah, I mean I mean, look,

00:06:01.894 --> 00:06:02.962
I mean, to hear the way

00:06:02.962 --> 00:06:05.531
Prigozhin is speaking about this

00:06:05.531 --> 00:06:06.532
and talking about

00:06:06.532 --> 00:06:09.402
how the children of the elites in Moscow

00:06:09.402 --> 00:06:10.737
are putting cream on their face

00:06:10.737 --> 00:06:11.604
while the

00:06:11.604 --> 00:06:14.040
while the sons of the people are dying

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:17.043
in Ukraine suggests to me

00:06:17.043 --> 00:06:20.146
that something is afoot in Russia

00:06:20.646 --> 00:06:22.048
that sees that not only was this

00:06:22.048 --> 00:06:23.950
an unjustified war.

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:25.451
Remember when Vladimir Putin launched

00:06:25.451 --> 00:06:26.619
this invasion of Ukraine,

00:06:26.619 --> 00:06:28.454
he said it'd be over in a week,

00:06:28.454 --> 00:06:29.856
but he underestimated

00:06:29.856 --> 00:06:30.857
the Ukrainian military

00:06:30.857 --> 00:06:33.426
and candidly underestimated the resolve

00:06:33.426 --> 00:06:34.293
of the free world.

00:06:35.294 --> 00:06:35.862
But I

00:06:35.862 --> 00:06:38.765
have to believe in my heart of hearts

00:06:38.765 --> 00:06:40.933
that there are good and decent people

00:06:41.567 --> 00:06:43.736
among the populists and in Russia

00:06:44.137 --> 00:06:45.972
who are getting fed up

00:06:45.972 --> 00:06:47.573
with this failed invasion,

00:06:47.573 --> 00:06:49.842
with the loss of life.

00:06:49.842 --> 00:06:50.910
And my hope is that

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:52.979
that's actually reached all the way

00:06:52.979 --> 00:06:53.913
into the highest levels

00:06:53.913 --> 00:06:54.714
of government as well.

00:06:54.714 --> 00:06:55.548
And to that point,

00:06:55.548 --> 00:06:56.416
the foreign minister here

00:06:56.416 --> 00:06:57.383
in Ukraine earlier

00:06:57.383 --> 00:06:58.084
this week told me

00:06:58.084 --> 00:06:59.051
and his quote was,

00:06:59.051 --> 00:07:01.954
Ferguson is just the first one to dare.

00:07:02.221 --> 00:07:03.289
But I have no doubt

00:07:03.289 --> 00:07:05.324
that others will follow.

00:07:05.324 --> 00:07:06.259
Do you think that's what the U.S.

00:07:06.259 --> 00:07:07.493
should be prepared for,

00:07:07.493 --> 00:07:09.429
a Russia without Putin?

00:07:09.429 --> 00:07:10.596
Is his power waning?

00:07:10.596 --> 00:07:13.199
Well, I think the United States should

00:07:13.199 --> 00:07:15.802
continue to be prepared

00:07:15.802 --> 00:07:18.638
to provide the courageous military here

00:07:18.638 --> 00:07:19.939
in Ukraine with the resources

00:07:19.939 --> 00:07:22.008
they need to fight and win.

00:07:22.008 --> 00:07:23.075
But I will say to you, Erin,

00:07:24.177 --> 00:07:24.577
well,

00:07:24.644 --> 00:07:25.077
while I

00:07:25.077 --> 00:07:25.845
strongly support

00:07:25.845 --> 00:07:28.381
American involvement here,

00:07:28.681 --> 00:07:30.450
I heard again today

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:32.151
frustration about how slow

00:07:32.151 --> 00:07:33.152
the Biden administration

00:07:33.152 --> 00:07:34.720
has been in providing

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:35.955
that military support.

00:07:35.955 --> 00:07:39.459
33 Abrams tanks were pledged in January,

00:07:39.959 --> 00:07:40.927
and now they're being told

00:07:40.927 --> 00:07:41.694
that they won't be here

00:07:41.694 --> 00:07:44.697
until September of They've now

00:07:44.697 --> 00:07:45.998
authorized allowing people

00:07:45.998 --> 00:07:48.301
to be trained in F-16s,

00:07:48.301 --> 00:07:49.535
but the United States continues

00:07:49.535 --> 00:07:51.003
to hold back on allowing

00:07:51.003 --> 00:07:51.804
said they're not going to get him,

00:07:51.804 --> 00:07:52.071
he doesn't

00:07:52.071 --> 00:07:53.206
think, till the beginning of next year.

00:07:53.206 --> 00:07:55.374
Well, what good does that do?

00:07:55.608 --> 00:07:56.375
My hope is that

00:07:56.375 --> 00:07:57.210
this war is over

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:58.711
by the beginning of next year.

00:07:58.711 --> 00:08:00.379
So you think the aid needs to come fast?

00:08:00.379 --> 00:08:03.049
Look, I want to say I want to say

00:08:03.449 --> 00:08:04.650
very sincerely.

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.152
President Biden said

00:08:06.152 --> 00:08:07.753
in his last State of the Union address

00:08:07.753 --> 00:08:09.088
that we're there as long as it takes.

00:08:09.088 --> 00:08:10.890
I think it shouldn't take that long.

00:08:10.890 --> 00:08:12.492
We're the most powerful nation on Earth.

00:08:12.492 --> 00:08:12.725
We have

00:08:12.725 --> 00:08:15.094
the most powerful military on earth.

00:08:15.094 --> 00:08:16.863
And we ought to be providing them

00:08:16.863 --> 00:08:17.997
with the tanks,

00:08:17.997 --> 00:08:19.065
with the missiles,

00:08:19.065 --> 00:08:20.032
with the aircraft

00:08:20.032 --> 00:08:20.900
and with the what

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:22.235
the Ukrainian soldiers approve.

00:08:22.235 --> 00:08:23.169
Those soldiers that you saw

00:08:23.169 --> 00:08:24.604
on the frontline today. Yes.

00:08:24.604 --> 00:08:25.404
You give them the means

00:08:25.404 --> 00:08:26.506
to fight the Russians.

00:08:26.506 --> 00:08:28.040
They're going to fight them to them,

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:28.975
and they're going to win a victory

00:08:28.975 --> 00:08:30.576
not just for Ukraine,

00:08:30.576 --> 00:08:31.611
but they're going to win a victory

00:08:31.611 --> 00:08:32.612
for the free world.

00:08:32.612 --> 00:08:33.946
And America

00:08:33.946 --> 00:08:34.947
and nations across

00:08:34.947 --> 00:08:36.482
the globe will be more secure

00:08:36.482 --> 00:08:37.016
as a result.

00:08:37.016 --> 00:08:38.284
You're clear on F-16s

00:08:38.284 --> 00:08:39.952
where you stand sooner, sooner

00:08:39.952 --> 00:08:40.453
rather than later.

00:08:40.453 --> 00:08:41.754
But also, you mentioned missiles

00:08:41.754 --> 00:08:42.622
attack them

00:08:42.622 --> 00:08:43.956
Number one on the wish list here,

00:08:43.956 --> 00:08:44.991
you think that should be.

00:08:46.058 --> 00:08:46.893
Now, I do.

00:08:46.893 --> 00:08:47.860
I heard about the

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:50.162
need for more mortar shells.

00:08:50.162 --> 00:08:51.464
I mean, the

00:08:51.464 --> 00:08:52.164
not getting into

00:08:52.164 --> 00:08:55.201
the technical part of it, but

00:08:55.201 --> 00:08:56.903
they need more ammunition.

00:08:56.903 --> 00:08:59.338
And I think it's I think it's imperative

00:08:59.338 --> 00:09:00.806
that we continue to provide that.

00:09:00.806 --> 00:09:01.440
Look, we

00:09:01.574 --> 00:09:03.209
we should never send American forces

00:09:03.209 --> 00:09:04.577
into this fight.

00:09:05.044 --> 00:09:07.213
The war here in Ukraine is not our war,

00:09:07.213 --> 00:09:08.881
but freedom is our fight.

00:09:08.881 --> 00:09:10.149
And since the days of the Reagan

00:09:10.149 --> 00:09:11.217
administration, America's

00:09:11.217 --> 00:09:12.585
always taken the position

00:09:12.585 --> 00:09:13.953
that if you're willing to fight

00:09:13.953 --> 00:09:15.421
America's enemies on your soil,

00:09:15.421 --> 00:09:16.155
we'll give you the means

00:09:16.155 --> 00:09:16.822
to fight them there

00:09:16.822 --> 00:09:18.591
so we don't have to fight them here.

00:09:18.591 --> 00:09:20.192
That's what this has been about

00:09:20.192 --> 00:09:21.360
from the very beginning.

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:23.129
I know there's debate

00:09:23.129 --> 00:09:24.063
both in my party

00:09:24.063 --> 00:09:25.498
and around the country

00:09:25.498 --> 00:09:27.033
about American involvement here,

00:09:27.033 --> 00:09:28.701
but I really believe

00:09:28.701 --> 00:09:31.470
that the majority of the American people

00:09:31.771 --> 00:09:33.139
understand that

00:09:33.139 --> 00:09:34.907
we are the leader of the free world

00:09:34.907 --> 00:09:36.676
and standing for freedom and supporting

00:09:36.676 --> 00:09:38.578
those that are fighting for their freedom

00:09:38.578 --> 00:09:40.379
is always the American cause.

00:09:40.379 --> 00:09:41.681
All of this in the context of,

00:09:41.681 --> 00:09:42.248
of course,

00:09:42.248 --> 00:09:43.182
the election

00:09:43.182 --> 00:09:44.984
and your race for the White House.

00:09:44.984 --> 00:09:46.352
We have obtained here at CNN

00:09:46.352 --> 00:09:47.520
the audio tape of former

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:48.154
President Trump

00:09:48.154 --> 00:09:49.822
talking about classified documents

00:09:49.822 --> 00:09:52.458
found at Mar a Lago this week.

00:09:52.758 --> 00:09:54.226
Here's what he said.

00:09:54.226 --> 00:09:56.596
I just feel isn't that amazing?

00:09:56.596 --> 00:09:58.898
Just totally wins my case, you know,

00:09:58.898 --> 00:10:01.567
except it is like highly confidential.

00:10:02.868 --> 00:10:03.169
There's

00:10:03.169 --> 00:10:04.503
a secret info

00:10:04.503 --> 00:10:05.404
that says, president,

00:10:05.404 --> 00:10:06.172
I could have details.

00:10:06.172 --> 00:10:09.241
You know, I can't, you know, but this is.

00:10:09.241 --> 00:10:11.477
So this tape relates to just one

00:10:11.477 --> 00:10:12.578
of the allegations,

00:10:12.578 --> 00:10:14.013
right, in the indictment

00:10:14.013 --> 00:10:16.248
that says that Trump not only obstructed,

00:10:16.248 --> 00:10:17.483
but also justice,

00:10:17.483 --> 00:10:19.318
but that he also disseminated

00:10:19.318 --> 00:10:21.120
classified information.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:23.122
Are you comfortable with his behavior

00:10:23.122 --> 00:10:23.990
as you know it,

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:25.958
as you heard on that tape?

00:10:25.958 --> 00:10:28.561
Well, what I can tell you, Erin, is that

00:10:28.561 --> 00:10:29.395
handling classified

00:10:29.395 --> 00:10:32.298
material is a very serious matter.

00:10:32.298 --> 00:10:33.132
And

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:36.002
the allegations in the indictment

00:10:36.002 --> 00:10:37.803
against a former president are serious,

00:10:37.803 --> 00:10:39.672
but he does deserve his day in court.

00:10:39.672 --> 00:10:40.339
Yes.

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:43.109
This shouldn't be litigated

00:10:43.109 --> 00:10:44.276
in in the media.

00:10:44.276 --> 00:10:44.910
Should be

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.612
it should be litigated in a court of law.

00:10:46.612 --> 00:10:48.180
The president's entitled

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:49.081
to bring his defense.

00:10:49.081 --> 00:10:51.684
I want to let that process work out.

00:10:51.684 --> 00:10:52.284
Everybody's

00:10:52.284 --> 00:10:53.886
entitled to a presumption of innocence.

00:10:53.886 --> 00:10:54.687
So we'll

00:10:54.687 --> 00:10:55.621
we'll stand on that

00:10:55.621 --> 00:10:56.789
presumption of innocence.

00:10:56.789 --> 00:10:59.091
But I don't want to diminish

00:10:59.492 --> 00:11:01.260
the seriousness of these allegations

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:02.561
or diminish

00:11:02.561 --> 00:11:03.429
the former president's

00:11:03.429 --> 00:11:04.530
right to defend himself.

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:04.997
All right, Mr.

00:11:04.997 --> 00:11:05.564
Vice President,

00:11:05.564 --> 00:11:06.298
thank you very much

00:11:06.298 --> 00:11:07.733
for your time here in Kiev.

00:11:07.733 --> 00:11:09.068
Thank you. It's good to see you here.

